(2) Proceed past a traffic light or stop sign, but only slowing down as may be necessary for safe operation;
(3) Exceed the speed limits specified so long as he does not endanger life or property;
(4) Disregard regulations governing direction of movement or turning in specified directions so long as he does not endanger life or property.

